url: "https://www.one-course.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bvirrion/one-physics-book"
abstract: >
  A series of five free physics textbooks forming a single coherent
  course from Grade 1 to the end of the bachelor's degree. The High
  School book (grades 10–12) is complete, with graded exercises and full
  solutions, in English, French, Dutch, Spanish, Portuguese and Hindi.
  Part of the One Course project.
